  {
    "id": "lineAttentionGet",
    "method": "GET",
    "url": "/lines/{lineId}/attention",
    "summary": "Read the leader switcher attention flags for a line",
    "description": "Red-dot evidence (L-12): openViolations counts OPEN routing violations at the line's sub-stage, stuckWip counts batch positions parked there longer than 8 hours, and unfilledHour reports whether today has a daily-sheet row for the line's work process. Non-admin callers must lead or run the line.\n",
